MessageId=0xa00
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O1_SUMMARY
Language=English
M1: Operation Short Circuit
.

MessageId=0xa01
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O1_OBJ
Language=English
The force field above the beach blocks access to the enemy base at the top of the hill. Find the force field power control and blast it to bits.
.

MessageId=0xa02
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O1_COMP
Language=English
M1: Passage Clear
.

MessageId=0xa03
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O2_SUMMARY
Language=English
M2: Missile Control
.

MessageId=0xa04
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O2_OBJ
Language=English
The Base's Command Post is connected to a series of SAM sites. By destroying those connections, you can expose the Command Post core. Hit the core hard.
.

MessageId=0xa05
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O2_COMP
Language=English
M2: Missile Control Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xa06
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O3_SUMMARY
Language=English
M3: Destroy Rocket Sites
.

MessageId=0xa07
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O3_OBJ
Language=English
Fight off the forces that protect the rocket silos. Then, target the control panels before the rockets launch. Your efforts will keep the resistance alive.
.

MessageId=0xa08
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O3_COMP
Language=English
M3: Rocket Sites Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xa09
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O4_SUMMARY
Language=English
M4: Go to Landing Site
.

MessageId=0xa0a
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O4_OBJ
Language=English
Move on to the VTOL landing pad and guide the BFT into the cargo hold. The aircraft will transport you to the next campaign.
.

MessageId=0xa0b
SymbolicName=MSG_M1_O4_COMP
Language=English
M4: VTOL Pickup
.

MessageId=0xb00
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O1_SUMMARY
Language=English
M1: Retrieve Stolen Technology
.

MessageId=0xb01
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O1_OBJ
Language=English
Break into the Network lab. Fight off the security and refit the BFT with new technology. Then, you can reach enemy operations on the other side of the canyon.
.

MessageId=0xb02
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O1_COMP
Language=English
M1: Technology Retrieved
.

MessageId=0xb03
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O2_SUMMARY
Language=English
M2: Destroy Power Plant
.

MessageId=0xb04
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O2_OBJ
Language=English
The best way to weaken enemy forces is to destroy the main power supply. Blast through the Power Plant complex, then obliterate the core.
.

MessageId=0xb05
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O2_COMP
Language=English
M2: Power Plant Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xb06
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O3_SUMMARY
Language=English
M3: Destroy Mining Operation
.

MessageId=0xb07
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O3_OBJ
Language=English
Machines extract ore for weapon production from the mine pit. By destroying the digging devices in the pit, you'll be closer to drowning out the Network's efforts.
.

MessageId=0xb08
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O3_COMP
Language=English
M3: Mining Operation Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xb09
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O4_SUMMARY
Language=English
M4: Destroy Steel Processor
.

MessageId=0xb0a
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O4_OBJ
Language=English
The foundry is the heart of the Network's weapon production operation. Bust through its defenses and break it down with a barrage of BFT firepower!
.

MessageId=0xb0b
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O4_COMP
Language=English
M4: Foundry Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xb0c
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O5_SUMMARY
Language=English
M5: Proceed To Helipad
.

MessageId=0xb0d
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O5_OBJ
Language=English
A VTOL is on the way. Proceed to helipad for transport to the next area. If you've hit the bridge switch in the foundry, you'll be able to cross over to the pick up area.
.

MessageId=0xb0e
SymbolicName=MSG_M2_O5_COMP
Language=English
M5: Helipad Pickup
.

MessageId=0xc00
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O1_SUMMARY
Language=English
M1: Enter TNT Grounds
.

MessageId=0xc01
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O1_OBJ
Language=English
The volcano is in a huge crater that is protected by Network forces. Your first mission is to fight off the complex's exterior defenses and enter the main crater.
.

MessageId=0xc02
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O1_COMP
Language=English
M1: Entered TNT Grounds
.

MessageId=0xc03
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O2_SUMMARY
Language=English
M2: Cut off the Flow
.

MessageId=0xc04
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O2_OBJ
Language=English
A Lava pool blocks the bridge near two large craters. By destroying the pumps that fill the pool, you can drain the lava and clear the way.
.

MessageId=0xc05
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O2_COMP
Language=English
M2: Bridge Cleared
.

MessageId=0xc06
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O3_SUMMARY
Language=English
M3: Acquire Hover Technology
.

MessageId=0xc07
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O3_OBJ
Language=English
Make your way to the hovertank plant east of the volcano and put the BFT on the production line. Once you have the technology, you can sail smoothly to the volcano.
.

MessageId=0xc08
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O3_COMP
Language=English
M3: Hover Technology Acquired
.

MessageId=0xc09
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O4_SUMMARY
Language=English
M4: Enter Volcano Core
.

MessageId=0xc0a
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O4_OBJ
Language=English
Cross the lava to the volcano entrance and destroy the forces that block the entrance tunnel. Then, enter the volcano and keep blasting.
.

MessageId=0xc0b
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O4_COMP
Language=English
M4: Entered Volcano Core
.

MessageId=0xc0c
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O5_SUMMARY
Language=English
M5: Destroy TNT Beam
.

MessageId=0xc0d
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O5_OBJ
Language=English
The TNT Beam is in the volcano crater. Fight your way to the top. Then, target the beam. Its weak point is in the center. Avoid the lasers and attack.
.

MessageId=0xc0e
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O5_COMP
Language=English
M5: TNT Beam Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xc0f
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O6_SUMMARY
Language=English
M6: Go To VTOL Pickup
.

MessageId=0xc10
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O6_OBJ
Language=English
Get to the VTOL pad before the entire complex is swimming in lava!
.

MessageId=0xc11
SymbolicName=MSG_M3_O6_COMP
Language=English
M6: VTOL Pickup
.

MessageId=0xd00
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O1_SUMMARY
Language=English
M1: Break the Dam
.

MessageId=0xd01
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O1_OBJ
Language=English
The machines are making chemical weapons. The first step is to cut off their water supply. Destroy the flood gates of the main dam and let the water flow.
.

MessageId=0xd02
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O1_COMP
Language=English
M1: Dam Broken
.

MessageId=0xd03
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O2_SUMMARY
Language=English
M2: Destroy the Factory
.

MessageId=0xd04
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O2_OBJ
Language=English
The missile construction facility provides lift for the machine's chemical weapons. Take it out before the missiles are complete.
.

MessageId=0xd05
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O2_COMP
Language=English
M2: Missile Factory Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xd06
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O3_SUMMARY
Language=English
M3: Hit the Chemical Plant
.

MessageId=0xd07
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O3_OBJ
Language=English
The chemical production plant is volatile. With the right firepower, in the right places, you can bury it for good.
.

MessageId=0xd08
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O3_COMP
Language=English
M3: Chemical Plant Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xd09
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O4_SUMMARY
Language=English
M4: Find a Secret Weapon
.

MessageId=0xd0a
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O4_OBJ
Language=English
Reports show that the machines are constructing a secret weapon under the courtyard ruins. Find it and put an end to this new threat. 
.

MessageId=0xd0b
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O4_COMP
Language=English
M4: Weapon Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xd0c
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O5_SUMMARY
Language=English
M5: Go to VTOL Pickup 
.

MessageId=0xd0d
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O5_OBJ
Language=English
Now that the chemical threat is over, you can make your escape. Go to the VTOL landing site for pickup.
.

MessageId=0xd0e
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O5_COMP
Language=English
M5: VTOL Pickup
.

MessageId=0xd0f
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O6_SUMMARY
Language=English
Not Used
.

MessageId=0xd10
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O6_OBJ
Language=English
Not Used
.

MessageId=0xd11
SymbolicName=MSG_M4_O6_COMP
Language=English
Not Used
.

MessageId=0xe00
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O1_SUMMARY
Language=English
M1: Break the Ice
.

MessageId=0xe01
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O1_OBJ
Language=English
Access to enemy operations under the ice is blocked by a communications center. Knock out the enemy installation, then make your way under the icy surface.
.

MessageId=0xe02
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O1_COMP
Language=English
M1: Underground Access Achieved
.

MessageId=0xe03
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O2_SUMMARY
Language=English
M2: Stop Clone Shipment
.

MessageId=0xe04
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O2_OBJ
Language=English
A new batch is about to be shipped to the network's clone city. Work your way to the shipping entrance of the facility and destroy the clones.
.

MessageId=0xe05
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O2_COMP
Language=English
M2: Clone shipment Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xe06
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O3_SUMMARY
Language=English
M3: Get Sub Technology
.

MessageId=0xe07
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O3_OBJ
Language=English
Enemy operations are largely underwater. Go to the sub production facility and refit the BFT so that you can dive deep and destroy the underwater installations.
.

MessageId=0xe08
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O3_COMP
Language=English
M3: Received Sub Technology
.

MessageId=0xe09
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O4_SUMMARY
Language=English
M4: Destroy the Power Plant
.

MessageId=0xe0a
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O4_OBJ
Language=English
The machines get energy by extracting heat from the ocean floor. Dive down and place remote mines in the geo-thermal power plant's vents.
.

MessageId=0xe0b
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O4_COMP
Language=English
M4: Power Plant Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xe0c
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O5_SUMMARY
Language=English
M5: Destroy Clone Operation
.

MessageId=0xe0d
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O5_OBJ
Language=English
The way to enter the manufacturing plant is through underwater tunnels. Dive deep, cut through the ice cave and take apart the machine.
.

MessageId=0xe0e
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O5_COMP
Language=English
M5: Clone Operation Destroyed
.

MessageId=0xe0f
SymbolicName=MSG_M5_O6_SUMMARY
Language=English
