MessageId=0xf00
SymbolicName=MSG_M6_O1_SUMMARY
Language=English
M1: Go Underground
.

MessageId=0xf01
SymbolicName=MSG_M6_O1_OBJ
Language=English
The network is building a city underground. Fight your way to the elevator that leads to the construction site.
.

