.

MessageId=0xf03
SymbolicName=MSG_M6_O2_SUMMARY
Language=English
M2: Fight the Power
.

MessageId=0xf04
SymbolicName=MSG_M6_O2_OBJ
Language=English
Sensors show that the network's central core is powered by three remote power stations. You can reach them through transporters.
.

